    "text": "Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> Resistance of the system along the cylindrical axis,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfrac><mi>dx</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></munderover><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfrac><mi>dx</mi></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><munderover><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></munderover><mfrac><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msqrt><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi>